      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1300300843,
      "text": "Pollichia campestris, commonly known as waxberry or barley sugar bush, is a herbaceous plant in the family Caryophyllaceae and the only species in the monotypic genus Pollichia. It is found in southern and eastern Africa and in the Arabian peninsula."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Pollichia campestris",
